# Response headers for Cloudflare Pages (https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/).
# Vite copies this file into web/dist; Pages applies it on deploy. A Cache-Control set here
# replaces the Pages default "public, max-age=0, must-revalidate".
#
# Only files whose name changes with their content may be cached for a year, unchecked:
#   /assets/*  everything Vite builds (JS, CSS); every file name carries a content hash.
#   /fonts/*   the self-hosted fonts (src/styles/fonts.css); a changed font gets a new name.
# Everything else (the HTML pages, /data/, sitemap.xml, robots.txt, ads.txt, icons) keeps the
# default: the browser checks with Cloudflare on every visit, so a deploy is visible at once.
# The zone setting Caching > Configuration > Browser Cache TTL must stay on "Respect Existing
# Headers" (docs/handleiding.md, 4.7), or Cloudflare overrides these values.

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

# Security headers on every response (added 2026-11-12, security check before the AdSense request).
#   Strict-Transport-Security  browsers only ever use HTTPS for this host. No includeSubDomains and
#                              no preload: those bind every subdomain and are hard to undo.
#   Permissions-Policy         the site never asks for camera, microphone, payment or USB; a script
#                              that tries (also a third party's) is refused. Geolocation stays
#                              allowed: "mijn locatie" on the map uses it.
# Deliberately NOT set here:
#   Content-Security-Policy    a wrong one blocks AdSense or Google's consent message. Introduce it
#                              as Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only first, after the review.
#   X-Frame-Options            AdSense shows the site in a frame for its ad preview.
# X-Content-Type-Options and Referrer-Policy are already added by Cloudflare.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=()
